---
import { nextEvent } from '../../constants/home';
---

<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter py-20 items-center">
  <div class="md:col-span-7">
    <span class="text-secondary font-label-md tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 block">
      Comunidade Python
    </span>

    <h1
      class="font-display-lg text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-on-background mb-6 leading-tight text-balance"
    >
      Empoderando mulheres em tecnologia através do Python.
    </h1>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-10 max-w-xl">
      Somos um grupo internacional focado em ajudar mais mulheres a se tornarem participantes
      ativas e líderes na comunidade de código aberto Python. Na Beira, cultivamos conhecimento,
      rede de contatos e inovação tecnológica.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="/events"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-on-primary px-10 py-4 font-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-all rounded-lg"
      >
        Ver Workshops
      </a>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-outline text-on-surface px-10 py-4 font-label-md hover:bg-surface-container transition-all rounded-lg"
      >
        Nossa História
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="md:col-span-5 relative">
    <div
      class="aspect-[4/5] bg-surface-container overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-sm rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/home/hero-workshop.jpg"
        alt="Sessão de workshop da PyLadies Beira"
        width="512"
        height="384"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[20%] contrast-[110%]"
      />
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative mt-6 md:absolute md:-bottom-6 md:-left-6 bg-tertiary-container p-8 rounded-xl shadow-xl max-w-[280px]"
    >
      <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-on-tertiary-container mb-2">Próximo Evento</h2>
      <p class="text-on-tertiary-container opacity-90 font-label-md mb-4">{nextEvent.title}</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-tertiary-container font-bold">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" aria-hidden="true">calendar_today</span>
        <span class="text-sm">{nextEvent.date}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
